+def last_turn(path):
+    """(kind, text) of a transcript's final conversational record.
+
+    kind is "assistant" (text is that turn's text, possibly "" when the turn was
+    only a tool call), "user" (the last record is a USER record - a tool result or
+    an unanswered prompt; text is ""), or "none" (no user/assistant record could be
+    read). last_assistant_text() collapses all of these to "", which is right for
+    callers that only want text and wrong for any caller that must say WHY there is
+    none: a session wedged mid-tool-call and a session with nothing to read are not
+    the same thing (#2093).
+    """
